## C. Model Specifications

### Multiple Linear Regression
- Method: Ordinary Least Squares (OLS)
- Cross-validation: 10-fold, repeated 3 times
- Feature selection: All predictors included

### Random Forest
- Number of trees: 500
- Tuned parameter: mtry (variables per split)
- Cross-validation: 10-fold, repeated 3 times

### Gradient Boosted Trees
- Distribution: Gaussian (regression)
- Tuned parameters: n.trees, interaction.depth, shrinkage
- Cross-validation: 10-fold, repeated 3 times

### k-Nearest Neighbors
- Distance metric: Euclidean
- Tuned parameter: k (number of neighbors)
- Cross-validation: 5-fold
- Preprocessing: Feature scaling (center + scale)

### Ridge Regression
- Regularization: L2 (alpha = 0)
- Tuned parameter: lambda
- Cross-validation: 5-fold
- Preprocessing: Feature scaling (center + scale)

### Elastic Net
- Regularization: L1 + L2 (0 < alpha < 1)
- Tuned parameters: alpha (L1 ratio), lambda
- Cross-validation: 5-fold
- Preprocessing: Feature scaling (center + scale)
